title: "dba-admin-scripts: generic database and AWS command-line scripts"
abstract: >-
  General-purpose command-line scripts for database and cloud administration,
  covering routine administration, reporting, backup and restore, and setup
  tasks. Written to be readable and adaptable rather than tied to a particular
  deployment.
type: software
license: BSD-3-Clause
